      <div type="clause" n="3.3">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:HnComm">Hn com</ref> 3.3</head>
        <ab type="editionText" xml:lang="la" source="#robertson" n="3.3" corresp="#wit-sc">Et hoc duello fiat nisi in eis remanserit.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en" source="#robertson" corresp="#wit-sc">And the proof shall be by combat, unless they agree to some other mode of proof.</ab>
